<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV confirms Gas Natural sale.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV confirms Gas Natural sale.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock exchange commission CNMW confirmed on Friday the terms of the share offer for the government's 3.8 percent stake in energy group Gas Natural.</p>
<p>A notice in the press this morning said bids will be taken from Monday, November 25 until December 2 at 1300 GMT. Immediately after, state holding company SEPI will fix the placement price.</p>
<p>At closing prices yesterday, 3.8 percent of Gas Natural would be worth 35.58 billion pesetas. At 0940 GMT Gas Natural was trading 40 pesetas lower at 24,960.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
